# What must NOT enter the image build context (docker/podman read this).
#
# The context is the checkout, and the checkout accumulates things that are
# large, machine-local, or both: a 50 MB saved core, a failure log, agent
# worktrees with their own .git.  None of them belongs in an image, and each
# of them would also change the context hash on every run and defeat layer
# caching.  Keep this list in step with .gitignore.

.git
.gitignore
.claude
.claude/worktrees
.faillog
.suitelog
.suitelog-*
scratch
pcl.core
*.core
*~

# Development-only corpora and material: minutes of copying, and the image
# runs programs rather than PCL's own test suites.
perl-tests
cpan-tests
docs
baselines
ir-conform
Pl/t
